  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We factor the numerator and denominator and cancel any factors that they have in common.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4ab-8+10x}{10x+8-2ab} & =\\frac{2(2ab-4+5x)}{2(5x+4-ab)} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{2}(2ab-4+5x)}{\\cancel{2}(5x+4-ab)} \\\\  & =\\frac{2ab-4+5x}{5x+4-ab}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
